direction: down

open: Open Unfolded in any browser
support: Does this tab expose WebMCP? {
  shape: diamond
}
register: Register all 11 tools
ready: Agent can work directly in this exact tab
manual: Use the complete visual editor
solo: Keep designing without an agent
invite: Open in ChatGPT or copy the prompt
code: Mint a single-use 6-character code
agent: ChatGPT opens its internal WebMCP tab
join: Agent calls join_session
live: Human and agent edit one live design

open -> support
support -> register: Yes
register -> ready
support -> manual: No
manual -> solo: Work alone
manual -> invite: Ask for agent help
invite -> code
code -> agent
agent -> join
join -> live

*.style.border-radius: 12
open.style.fill: "#dbeafe"
open.style.stroke: "#2563eb"
support.style.fill: "#fef3c7"
support.style.stroke: "#d97706"
register.style.fill: "#ede9fe"
register.style.stroke: "#7c3aed"
ready.style.fill: "#d1fae5"
ready.style.stroke: "#059669"
manual.style.fill: "#f5f5f4"
manual.style.stroke: "#78716c"
solo.style.fill: "#d1fae5"
solo.style.stroke: "#059669"
invite.style.fill: "#dbeafe"
invite.style.stroke: "#2563eb"
code.style.fill: "#ffedd5"
code.style.stroke: "#ea580c"
agent.style.fill: "#ede9fe"
agent.style.stroke: "#7c3aed"
join.style.fill: "#ede9fe"
join.style.stroke: "#7c3aed"
live.style.fill: "#d1fae5"
live.style.stroke: "#059669"
